OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fine day with variable cloud
OL,6,Fand sunny spells. The odd mist and fog
OL,7,Fpatch is possible initially, while
OL,8,Fsome hill fog may linger over the
OL,9,FPennines and Moors with the odd spot
OL,10,Fof rain. Light winds. Remaining
OL,11,Frelatively mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPartly cloudy with clear
OL,14,Fspells leading to widespread mist and
OL,15,Ffog developing overnight, particularly
OL,16,Fthrough the Vale of York. Light winds.
OL,17,FTemperatures around average, but
OL,18,Fchilly in clearer areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
