OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FOvernight mist and fog clears
OL,6,Fslowly through the morning to give a
OL,7,Freasonable afternoon with sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Fog likely to return
OL,9,Fovernight. Light winds. Mild by day,
OL,10,Fchilly overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDamp
OL,13,Fand cloudy day on Saturday with mist
OL,14,Fand fog lingering. Remaining cloudy
OL,15,Fwith light rain overnight into Sunday.
OL,16,FDry and partly cloudy into Monday.
OL,17,FLight winds. Temperatures near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
